    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hope wont stop them. i saw what they did to the village in the valley... it wasnt just taking things, it was like they wanted to break everyone. i'd rather just sleep and not wake up to see them coming through that door. it feels like the only way to actually have some peace.",
